 7. 📊 Election mood music 
 
 
 &nbsp; 
 
 Data: NBC News poll . Chart: Noah Bressner/Axios More voters say they're dissatisfied (51%) with their personal financial situation than satisfied (49%) — a first in 30+ years of NBC News polling on the question.

 Even during the Great Recession, more voters were satisfied than dissatisfied. Photo: Fox News 📺 Sneak peek: Here's a first look at Fox News' new state-of-the-art control room at the network's headquarters in Midtown Manhattan, which'll be used tomorrow night as Bret Baier and Martha MacCallum lead Democracy 2026 midterm coverage.

 I'm told viewers will see advanced augmented reality graphics, immersive data visualizations and interactive election maps. More on the coverage . 
 
